node_modules/
.DS_Store

# dist/ IS committed, deliberately - the built output is what
# worker/wrangler.toml's [assets] binding actually deploys, and this
# repo's CI never builds web/ (deploy-worker.yml only runs inside
# worker/) - see that comment for the full reasoning. Rebuild
# (`npm run build`) and re-commit by hand whenever web/'s source
# changes; a stale dist/ silently serves old code, nothing will error.
